    new "Te fulmina con la mirada, pero no para. Tuviste suerte."

    old "She's clearly suspicious, but decides to let it go. You continue."
    new "Esta claramente sospechosa, pero decide dejarlo pasar. Continuan."

    old "She doesn't fully buy it, but doesn't want to stop. You got away with it."
    new "No lo cree del todo, pero no quiere parar. Te saliste con la tuya."

