    new "Niega con la cabeza pero no parece realmente molesta. Si acaso, lo disfruto."

    old "She's pissed, but the mood hasn't died for her. You keep going."
    new "Esta enojada, pero el animo no murio para ella. Siguen."

    old "She's angry, but clearly doesn't want to stop either."
    new "Esta enojada, pero claramente tampoco quiere parar."

    # ── Scene end narration ──

    old "She's livid. She kicks you out of her room without another word."
    new "Esta furiosa. Te echa de su cuarto sin decir nada mas."

    old "She points at the door, shaking with rage. You leave in silence."
    new "Apunta a la puerta, temblando de rabia. Te vas en silencio."

    old "She grabs her things and storms out, disgusted."
    new "Agarra sus cosas y se va furiosa, asqueada."

    old "She gets up and leaves without looking back. You went too far."
    new "Se levanta y se va sin mirar atras. Fuiste demasiado lejos."

    # ── Detection narration ──

